%N A365755 Expansion of  (1/x) * Series_Reversion( x*(1-x)/(1+x)^5 ).
%F A365755 a(n) = (1/(n+1)) * Sum_{k=0..n} binomial(n+k,k) * binomial(5*(n+1),n-k).
%F A365755 D-finite with recurrence 3*n*(3*n+2)*(3*n+4)*(n+1)*(62*n^2-31*n+3)*a(n) +24*n*(7254*n^5+7254*n^4+72*n^3-1142*n^2-117*n+14)*a(n-1) -80*(5*n-4)*(5*n-3)*(5*n-2)*(5*n-1)*(62*n^2+93*n+34)*a(n-2)=0. - _R. J. Mathar_, Nov 02 2026
%o A365755 (PARI) a(n) = sum(k=0, n, binomial(n+k, k)*binomial(5*(n+1), n-k))/(n+1);
